Description: Android-style application folders for Ubuntu Dock
 Group applications by dragging one dock icon onto another. Reorder them
 inside folders or move them back to the dock. Each folder shows real
 application icons and a shared running indicator.
 .
 Customize names, labels, colors, transparency and wallpaper. Choose among
 eight animations and adjust each folder background blur. The interface follows
 the system language and includes 30 translations.
 .
 Supports Ubuntu 26.04 / GNOME 50 and Ubuntu 24.04 / GNOME 46 with Ubuntu Dock.
 Run ubuntu-dock-folders enable --ubuntu-settings as your desktop user,
 then log out and back in.
